# Replace these placeholders with your deployed Cloud Run suffix and a signed-in
# admin's Firebase ID token. Tokens must not be committed to this file.
@firebaseSuffix = -YOUR-CLOUD-RUN-SUFFIX.a.run.app
@idToken = YOUR_FIREBASE_ID_TOKEN

### Global user summary
GET https://getAdminAccountSummary{{firebaseSuffix}}?type=users
Authorization: Bearer {{idToken}}

### Global rider summary
GET https://getAdminAccountSummary{{firebaseSuffix}}?type=riders
Authorization: Bearer {{idToken}}

### Global shipment summary (every head office)
GET https://getAdminOrderSummary{{firebaseSuffix}}?type=shipment
Authorization: Bearer {{idToken}}

### Global rides and courier summary (shared RideHaulingOrders collection)
GET https://getAdminOrderSummary{{firebaseSuffix}}?type=ride-courier
Authorization: Bearer {{idToken}}

### Global food order summary
GET https://getAdminOrderSummary{{firebaseSuffix}}?type=food
Authorization: Bearer {{idToken}}

### Global ecommerce order summary
GET https://getAdminOrderSummary{{firebaseSuffix}}?type=ecommerce
Authorization: Bearer {{idToken}}
